{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5870213f-53fc-88e1-99fc-5f24808e5d91",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T14:50:25-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonella Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:42:53-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:42:59-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yes, I'm calling about a puddle. Well, it's more than a puddle, it's a whole pond across half the road. On Callender Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:43:11-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Whereabouts on Callender? Do you have a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:43:16-04:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm at 161. Right out front, practically. In the North End, down by where the old, um, the old gas station used to be. No, wait, that's been a... it's not a gas station anymore, it's been something else for years. Anyway, it's near there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:43:38-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I've got 161 Callender. Tell me what you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:43:44-04:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water. Sitting there. It covers about half the width of the road, and the cars go around it real slow, and it throws up a wave when they go through. And here's the thing, it hasn't rained since the weekend. Not a drop. It's Thursday. The sun's been out. So where's it coming from, and why isn't it going down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:44:12-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not normal if it's been dry for days. Is there a storm drain right there, a grate by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:44:23-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate, yes, by the curb on my side. I don't see it taking anything. The water's just sitting over it, flat. Doesn't swirl, doesn't move."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:44:36-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be blocked, could be a broken pipe underneath. Is the water clear or does it look dirty or smell at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:44:47-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's kind of cloudy. Not a terrible smell. A little musty, maybe. I'm not putting my face in it, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:44:57-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Fair enough. Okay, I'm writing that down. Anything else you notice around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:45:04-04:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, actually. There's a manhole cover, maybe ten feet up from the puddle toward the corner. And it looks off to me. Like it's sitting an inch higher on one side, or lower, I can't tell. It's not flush, anyway. I noticed it because a truck went over it and it made a clunk. A clunk, like it was loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:45:32-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's good to know. That one I'll note separately, because a cover that's not seated right is a safety thing. Is it in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:45:45-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the lane, yes. Where the cars go when they swerve around the water. So they're swerving toward it, practically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:45:56-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll flag that so they look at both at the same time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:46:03-04:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because this isn't new, you know. This has been going on. I've seen it wet before, but it always went away after a day or so. This time it's just sitting. I'm tired of looking at it, honestly. Every time something's wrong on this street, I'm the one who has to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:46:28-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Have you called about this spot before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:46:34-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not about this exact thing, no. But I've called about other stuff on the street, years back. Nothing ever gets done fast. You call, and then you wait, and then you call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:46:50-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll put this in now so there's a record from today. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:46:59-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonella Barone. B-A-R-O-N-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:01-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Barone. And do you want a callback number on the work order?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:09-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0189. That's my cell. I'm on it now, I'm actually out. I'm at the copy shop making a stack of flyers, so if it cuts out, that's why. The machine's loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:25-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'm reading that back: 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:29-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:31-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I've got a standing puddle across about half the road at 161 Callender, no rain since the weekend, grate not draining, plus a manhole cover that's not flush, in the travel lane. I'll send it to the crew that handles drainage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:47:52-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And, um, can I ask, do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's still there Saturday, I don't want to hear it'll be Monday, Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:48:05-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do have people on for urgent things on weekends, but a standing puddle usually goes into the regular weekday queue. The manhole cover might get bumped up since it's a hazard. I'll mark it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:48:23-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Well, mark it hard, then. Because somebody's going to hit that and blow a tire, or worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:48:32-04:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note it as a hazard in the lane. If it gets worse before they get there, like the water spreads or the cover shifts more, call back and say it's an update to this report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:48:50-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a number I should write down? I'm holding flyers, I don't have a pen, but I can remember it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:01-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just call the main Public Works line again, the same one you called now, and ask for the drainage report at Callender. Anyone can pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:14-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. The same number. I'll remember that. It's on my phone anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:21-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There you go. Anything else on Callender I should add while I've got you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:28-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's the main thing. Well, the pothole by the, the old laundromat. Oh, it's a nail salon now. Never mind, that's another day. I'll deal with that separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:42-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Call back on that one and we'll get it logged too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:49:49-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. I just hope somebody comes out this time, and soon. It's been a long week of looking at that water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:50:00-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it in, Ms. Barone. Someone from the crew should be out to take a look in the next few working days, sooner for the cover if they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:50:15-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Denise. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:50:19-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T14:50:23-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
